{
 "text": "You can now run Claude Code with unlimited usage, completely free.\n\nSave this before you hit your limit mid-session and lose everything you were working on.\n\nSomeone on GitHub just built a free tool called 9Router.\n\nIt acts as a silent bridge between Claude Code and free AI providers like Gemini, Kimi, and GLM.\n\nIt sits in the background and you never have to think about it.\n\nThe second your Claude limit runs out, it doesn't ask you what to do.\n\nIt just switches to the next available provider on its own, all the way down to completely free models if it needs to.\n\nYour session keeps going like nothing happened.\n\nYou set it up once, connect your providers, and from that moment on, 9Router manages everything automatically.\n\nNo manual switching. No interruptions. No extra cost.\n\nAnd it's not just for Claude Code. Cursor, Codex, Antigravity, and almost every other AI coding tool out there works with it straight out of the box.\n\nOne free tool. Zero interruptions. Unlimited sessions.\n\nFollow for more free AI tools like this one.",
